Package: com.securitylab.pikminauto
Name: Pikmin Auto
Version: 0.10.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Own-device Pikmin Bloom automation — numbers every Pikmin in pluck order, and runs the whole nectar pipeline automatically, always on, no UI: keep a planting session going with the plain petal stack we hold the most of, claim nectar from bloomed big flowers in range, send and collect expeditions, feed the squad, harvest petals, plant seedlings into free planter slots and pluck ripe ones — all through the game own RPCs. Also dumps the visible map objects to Documents/mapobjects.json for GPS Wander.
Author: security-lab
Maintainer: security-lab
Section: Development
Depends: ellekit
